WEBVTT

00:00:02.402 --> 00:00:04.836
Captain's Log,
Stardate 41463.9:

00:00:04.871 --> 00:00:07.101
While mapping
the Pleiades Cluster

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:09.608
we've been asked
by the Federation

00:00:09.642 --> 00:00:12.338
to visit a group
terraforming Velara lll.

00:00:12.379 --> 00:00:13.846
Communications
have been erratic

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:16.212
and there is some concern
about their welfare.

00:00:16.249 --> 00:00:17.807
Entering
standard orbit...

00:00:17.851 --> 00:00:19.318
now.

00:00:19.352 --> 00:00:21.377
It takes special people
to live in such desolation.

00:00:21.421 --> 00:00:23.446
Visionaries who don't see
the planet as it is

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:24.787
but as it will be.

00:00:24.824 --> 00:00:27.122
I've always wanted to see
terraforming in operation.

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:28.127
Lieutenant Yar.

00:00:28.161 --> 00:00:29.321
Hailing frequencies.

00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:30.852
Hailing frequencies open, sir.

00:00:30.897 --> 00:00:32.330
Velara lll base

00:00:32.365 --> 00:00:35.766
this is Captain Picard
of the Starship Enterprise.

00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:48.803
No malfunctioning equipment
on either side, sir.

00:00:48.848 --> 00:00:50.110
They are receiving us.

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:52.550
Velara lll base,
this is the Enterprise.

00:00:52.585 --> 00:00:54.314
Come in please. Over.

00:00:54.354 --> 00:00:57.551
Maybe no one's home.

00:01:00.894 --> 00:01:03.124
We are sensing life-forms, sir.

00:01:03.163 --> 00:01:06.963
Velara lll base, do you copy?

00:01:07.033 --> 00:01:10.628
Velara base to Enterprise.

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:13.764
Yes, Captain.
I'm Director Mandl

00:01:13.807 --> 00:01:16.275
and I'm sorry about the delay

00:01:16.309 --> 00:01:18.641
but we weren't
expecting visitors.

00:01:18.678 --> 00:01:20.771
Terraform Command has asked us

00:01:20.814 --> 00:01:23.180
to see how you were
getting along.

00:01:23.216 --> 00:01:26.083
We were a little behind,
but we're back on schedule

00:01:26.119 --> 00:01:27.450
and I'd like to hope

00:01:27.487 --> 00:01:30.979
we'd be allowed
to maintain that schedule.

00:01:31.024 --> 00:01:34.016
We alarm him
for some reason.

00:01:35.662 --> 00:01:38.460
Your staff are all well,
I presume, Director.

00:01:38.498 --> 00:01:39.965
Understandably tired.

00:01:39.999 --> 00:01:42.467
We're working very hard,
Captain.

00:01:42.502 --> 00:01:45.403
Well, if there is anything
that we can do to help...

00:01:45.438 --> 00:01:47.736
you and your staff
are very welcome aboard

00:01:47.774 --> 00:01:49.571
for a change
of scene, rest.

00:01:49.609 --> 00:01:51.474
We have some holodecks
which you might enjoy.

00:01:51.511 --> 00:01:52.535
No disrespect, sir

00:01:52.579 --> 00:01:55.013
but we cannot afford the time.

00:01:55.115 --> 00:01:56.548
Channel closed.

00:01:56.583 --> 00:01:58.813
His fear is escalating.

00:01:58.852 --> 00:02:02.754
If you'll excuse me, sir, l...
I really must get back to work.

00:02:02.789 --> 00:02:04.780
I sense deliberate
concealment, sir.

00:02:04.824 --> 00:02:06.291
Of what?

00:02:06.326 --> 00:02:08.453
I don't know,
but it's intense.

00:02:08.495 --> 00:02:10.463
Director Mandl, we've heard

00:02:10.497 --> 00:02:13.796
of your remarkable achievements
in terraforming.

00:02:13.833 --> 00:02:17.291
My crew would very much
appreciate looking around.

00:02:17.337 --> 00:02:19.669
This is not really
the best time.

00:02:19.706 --> 00:02:22.231
We're at a very critical phase
just now.

00:02:22.275 --> 00:02:23.970
We would require
no special attention.

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:25.739
I'm trying not being rude, sir

00:02:25.778 --> 00:02:30.738
but this is really
very inconvenient.

00:02:30.783 --> 00:02:32.751
He is concealing something.

00:02:32.785 --> 00:02:35.310
It's more than
just being too busy.

00:02:35.355 --> 00:02:37.983
Your announcement
about coming down

00:02:38.057 --> 00:02:40.992
has sent him almost
to a point of panic.

00:02:41.027 --> 00:02:43.723
Well, whether he wants us
or not...

00:02:43.763 --> 00:02:45.196
Director Mandl

00:02:45.231 --> 00:02:48.667
unless you're absolutely
refusing us permission

00:02:48.701 --> 00:02:50.532
to land at your station

00:02:50.570 --> 00:02:53.004
prepare to receive
our away team.

00:02:53.072 --> 00:02:54.835
As you wish.

00:02:58.044 --> 00:03:00.342
Counselor, perhaps
you better go along as well.

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:02.109
Aye, sir.

00:03:02.148 --> 00:03:04.275
Someone that tense
can be very unpredictable.

00:03:04.317 --> 00:03:06.046
Stay on your toes,
Number One.

00:03:31.843 --> 00:03:37.304
Space, the final frontier.

00:03:37.349 --> 00:03:41.149
These are the voyages
of the Starship Enterprise.

00:03:41.186 --> 00:03:43.154
Its continuing mission--

00:03:43.188 --> 00:03:46.817
to explore
strange new worlds

00:03:46.858 --> 00:03:51.557
to seek out new life
and new civilizations

00:03:51.596 --> 00:03:57.000
to boldly go
where no one has gone before.

00:05:13.110 --> 00:05:15.237
Welcome to Velara lll.

00:05:15.279 --> 00:05:16.940
Please.

00:05:16.981 --> 00:05:20.508
I want you to remember it
as it is now

00:05:20.551 --> 00:05:25.682
because in a couple of decades,
you won't recognize it.

00:05:25.723 --> 00:05:29.284
Luisa Kim,
gardener of Edens.

00:05:29.327 --> 00:05:31.818
Commander William Riker,
USS Enterprise.

00:05:31.863 --> 00:05:33.922
This is Counselor Troi,
Lieutenant Yar

00:05:33.965 --> 00:05:36.559
Lieutenant La Forge,
Lieutenant Commander Data.

00:05:36.601 --> 00:05:39.069
Arthur Malencon,
hydraulics specialist

00:05:39.103 --> 00:05:42.504
and Bjorn Bensen,
chief engineer.

00:05:44.175 --> 00:05:45.733
An android?

00:05:45.776 --> 00:05:48.643
And third in command
of the Enterprise.

00:05:48.679 --> 00:05:50.670
Where were you
manufactured?

00:05:50.715 --> 00:05:52.615
Are there others like you?

00:05:52.650 --> 00:05:55.949
Both matters are subjects
of protracted discussion.

00:05:55.987 --> 00:05:58.820
Remarkable.

00:05:58.856 --> 00:06:00.949
Excuse me.

00:06:03.895 --> 00:06:06.363
We don't get many visitors.

00:06:06.397 --> 00:06:08.490
It's exciting
to have you here.

00:06:08.532 --> 00:06:10.727
We weren't sure
how we would be received.

00:06:10.768 --> 00:06:13.931
Director Mandl was less than
enthusiastic about our interest.

00:06:14.005 --> 00:06:16.337
I should apologize for him.

00:06:16.374 --> 00:06:18.740
We are at a critical phase.

00:06:18.776 --> 00:06:21.336
Usually, he's quite charming.

00:06:21.379 --> 00:06:23.677
We'll try to stay
out of the way.

00:06:23.714 --> 00:06:26.547
We've never seen
a terraforming station

00:06:26.584 --> 00:06:28.711
and we appreciate
the opportunity.

00:06:28.753 --> 00:06:30.084
How much do you know
about the process?

00:06:30.121 --> 00:06:33.352
Theories, reports,
but nothing firsthand.

00:06:33.391 --> 00:06:35.120
Oh, wonderful.
Let me show you what we do.

00:06:35.159 --> 00:06:37.184
Newcomers find
this imager helpful.

00:06:37.228 --> 00:06:39.287
The other two
are secretive

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:41.958
but she is as open
as she appears.

00:06:41.999 --> 00:06:44.194
What we're doing is
so exciting, so inspiring.

00:06:44.235 --> 00:06:46.100
We take a lifeless planet

00:06:46.137 --> 00:06:47.604
and little by little

00:06:47.638 --> 00:06:49.936
transform it
to an M-Class environment

00:06:49.974 --> 00:06:54.638
capable of supporting life.

00:06:54.679 --> 00:06:57.580
Terraforming makes you
feel a little godlike.

00:06:57.615 --> 00:07:00.778
The first phase involves
selecting the planet.

00:07:00.818 --> 00:07:02.342
That's very important.

00:07:02.386 --> 00:07:05.048
It must have
the right mass and gravity

00:07:05.089 --> 00:07:06.920
a correct rate of rotation

00:07:06.958 --> 00:07:09.586
and a balanced
day and night.

00:07:09.627 --> 00:07:11.891
The planet must also
be without life

00:07:11.929 --> 00:07:14.830
or the prospect of life
developing naturally.

00:07:14.865 --> 00:07:17.231
The Federation
determines if that's so.

00:07:17.268 --> 00:07:19.896
Then, we take over.

00:07:22.006 --> 00:07:23.871
This station is Phase 2.

00:07:23.908 --> 00:07:25.842
Phase 3 involves water.

00:07:25.876 --> 00:07:29.676
Usually we create basins
using hydraulic landscaping

00:07:29.714 --> 00:07:32.774
but the water on this planet
is subsurface

00:07:32.817 --> 00:07:35.308
and extremely high
in salt content.

00:07:35.353 --> 00:07:40.347
We're just about to begin
pumping and filtering the water

00:07:40.391 --> 00:07:44.919
removing the salt,
oxygenating and replacing.

00:07:44.962 --> 00:07:48.329
Next, we introduce
microorganisms

00:07:48.366 --> 00:07:51.233
and when the process is complete

00:07:51.268 --> 00:07:54.965
we'll have a lush,
arable biosphere.

00:07:55.039 --> 00:07:56.939
You make it
sound poetic.

00:07:56.974 --> 00:08:02.037
I think it's the best
job in the universe.

00:08:03.614 --> 00:08:06.549
The efficiency of your
hydraulic landscaping

00:08:06.584 --> 00:08:08.108
is quite elegant.

00:08:08.152 --> 00:08:10.882
Well, it isn't yet,
but it will be.

00:08:10.921 --> 00:08:14.652
Right now, I'm disturbed
by erratic power surges

00:08:14.692 --> 00:08:17.252
in several
of the servomechanisms

00:08:17.294 --> 00:08:18.921
that control the
hydraulic probes.

00:08:18.963 --> 00:08:20.487
Could the
increased conductivity

00:08:20.531 --> 00:08:22.362
be caused by
the high saline content?

00:08:22.400 --> 00:08:23.924
That was my first thought,
but l...

00:08:24.035 --> 00:08:25.332
Arthur!

00:08:25.369 --> 00:08:29.396
The factors do not
support that conclusion.

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:31.135
I'm Director Mandl

00:08:31.175 --> 00:08:33.735
and I'm sorry
about having been so abrupt

00:08:33.778 --> 00:08:36.713
during our initial contact,
but being isolated

00:08:36.747 --> 00:08:39.147
one tends to forget
the social graces.

00:08:39.183 --> 00:08:41.378
Are you seeing
everything that you want?

00:08:41.419 --> 00:08:43.751
What you're doing
here is miraculous.

00:08:43.788 --> 00:08:44.846
What we're doing here

00:08:44.889 --> 00:08:47.255
is working a difficult
and demanding timetable

00:08:47.291 --> 00:08:48.758
and there will be no miracle

00:08:48.793 --> 00:08:50.954
unless Malencon here

00:08:51.028 --> 00:08:55.192
gets the hydraulic probes
back on line.

00:08:55.232 --> 00:09:00.795
We are set to step up
to full conversion immediately.

00:09:00.838 --> 00:09:05.434
Shouldn't you be in
the hydraulic chamber, Arthur?

00:09:05.476 --> 00:09:07.376
Now?

00:09:07.411 --> 00:09:09.345
Yes.

00:09:11.415 --> 00:09:13.246
All right, Kurt.

00:09:13.284 --> 00:09:17.243
Geordi, this appears to be
the master subsurface pump.

00:09:17.288 --> 00:09:18.915
You're right. Very impressive.

00:09:18.989 --> 00:09:20.251
This is interesting.

00:09:20.291 --> 00:09:22.020
The water table
is a thin ribbon

00:09:22.059 --> 00:09:25.153
between the sandy surface layer
and the rocks below.

00:09:25.196 --> 00:09:28.529
And those two surfaces follow
that contour so precisely

00:09:28.566 --> 00:09:29.555
that the water maintains

00:09:29.600 --> 00:09:31.033
a consistent
depth between them.

00:09:31.068 --> 00:09:32.194
Which would require

00:09:32.236 --> 00:09:33.931
extreme precision
from the probe controls.

00:09:33.971 --> 00:09:35.461
Mm-hmm.

00:09:35.506 --> 00:09:38.475
Here we have something that
may be of interest to you--

00:09:38.509 --> 00:09:40.272
a vegetation graph.

00:09:40.311 --> 00:09:46.079
It is really the key center
for successful terraforming.

00:09:46.117 --> 00:09:50.554
Incredible. It's planned month
by month, decade by decade?

00:09:50.588 --> 00:09:55.287
Every single thing
is specific and exact.

00:09:55.326 --> 00:09:59.126
You see grand,
romantic concepts.

00:09:59.163 --> 00:10:01.688
I see unyielding rock

00:10:01.732 --> 00:10:03.700
under an ocean of sand.

00:10:03.734 --> 00:10:05.861
Commander!

00:10:05.903 --> 00:10:07.336
What is it, Deanna?

00:10:07.371 --> 00:10:09.703
Malencon... he's in trouble!

00:10:09.740 --> 00:10:11.503
Help! Help!

00:10:13.544 --> 00:10:14.704
Help!

00:10:16.680 --> 00:10:17.874
Can you open it?

00:10:17.915 --> 00:10:20.042
It's jammed.

00:10:48.379 --> 00:10:50.847
First Officer's Log,
Stardate 41464.3:

00:10:50.882 --> 00:10:53.680
What began as a routine visit
to a terraforming site

00:10:53.718 --> 00:10:56.186
has turned into something
far more serious.

00:10:56.220 --> 00:10:58.245
Arthur Malencon,
the hydraulics engineer

00:10:58.289 --> 00:11:00.587
has been critically injured
by a laser drill

00:11:00.625 --> 00:11:02.525
which appears
to have malfunctioned.

00:11:04.996 --> 00:11:07.965
Situation report, Number One.

00:11:07.999 --> 00:11:09.489
For safety reasons

00:11:09.533 --> 00:11:12.434
we're shutting off all power
to the hydraulics room

00:11:12.470 --> 00:11:14.495
before entering
to recover the body.

00:11:14.538 --> 00:11:16.529
Then we'll beam him up
to Sick Bay.

00:11:16.574 --> 00:11:18.974
But from the look of his wounds,
it's probably hopeless.

00:11:19.076 --> 00:11:20.873
Keep me informed.

00:11:20.912 --> 00:11:21.970
Data?

00:11:22.079 --> 00:11:23.910
Go ahead, Geordi.

00:11:23.948 --> 00:11:25.210
All set.

00:11:25.249 --> 00:11:27.877
Data, we have your section
completely powered down.

00:11:27.919 --> 00:11:30.820
Bensen has locked the master
servomotor drive system

00:11:30.855 --> 00:11:32.220
so it should be safe
in there now.

00:11:32.256 --> 00:11:33.985
I'm going in.

00:11:34.091 --> 00:11:35.786
I will go with you.

00:11:39.830 --> 00:11:41.991
Transporter Room,
this is Lieutenant Yar.

00:11:42.099 --> 00:11:44.533
Two to beam up to Sick Bay.

00:11:50.541 --> 00:11:52.008
I want to go.

00:11:52.076 --> 00:11:54.704
We should be with him.

00:11:57.214 --> 00:11:59.375
Kurt, please come, too.

00:12:06.857 --> 00:12:09.849
Transporter Room,
this is Commander Riker.

00:12:09.894 --> 00:12:11.885
Beam up four
at my coordinates.

00:12:17.001 --> 00:12:19.196
Geordi, this is intriguing.

00:12:19.236 --> 00:12:21.602
I have seen malfunctions

00:12:21.639 --> 00:12:27.976
but this is almost
as if the laser drill

00:12:28.045 --> 00:12:32.880
seemed to operate with a will

00:12:32.917 --> 00:12:36.375
separate from
its control console.

00:12:36.420 --> 00:12:38.945
I can't explain it.

00:12:38.990 --> 00:12:42.926
The laser blasts seemed to end
when the yelling stopped.

00:12:45.162 --> 00:12:48.325
Maybe Arthur stopped it,
only not in time.

00:12:48.366 --> 00:12:50.732
Not possible.

00:12:50.768 --> 00:12:52.395
Then what are you suggesting?

00:12:52.436 --> 00:12:54.336
Uncertain.

00:12:54.372 --> 00:12:55.999
Geordi

00:12:56.107 --> 00:12:58.507
please return power to the
control console in this room.

00:12:58.542 --> 00:13:00.476
I wish to reactivate
the program.

00:13:00.511 --> 00:13:02.376
You got it.

00:13:15.226 --> 00:13:18.627
I am now running
the base drilling program.

00:13:25.236 --> 00:13:26.863
Geordi, servos off!

00:13:26.904 --> 00:13:28.235
They are off!

00:13:28.272 --> 00:13:29.239
Data, what's happening?

00:13:29.273 --> 00:13:30.900
Too much to explain.

00:13:35.579 --> 00:13:37.706
Can you open
that? Do it!

00:13:37.748 --> 00:13:40.308
La Forge to Enterprise.
We have a problem.

00:13:40.351 --> 00:13:41.409
Be specific.

00:13:41.452 --> 00:13:42.976
Data's in the
hydraulics room alone

00:13:43.087 --> 00:13:44.577
and we're hearing
laser blasts.

00:13:44.622 --> 00:13:45.646
Get him out of there!

00:13:45.689 --> 00:13:47.247
It's not working again!

00:13:47.291 --> 00:13:48.815
We got to get
this door open.

00:13:48.859 --> 00:13:50.190
Data, we can't get in!

00:13:51.362 --> 00:13:52.522
Data!

00:13:53.697 --> 00:13:54.823
Data!

00:13:54.865 --> 00:13:56.355
Data!

00:14:02.039 --> 00:14:04.940
Away team, now!
What is happening?

00:14:04.975 --> 00:14:07.500
I'm going to beam him
out of there!

00:14:07.545 --> 00:14:09.945
Bridge, this is
Lieutenant Commander Data.

00:14:10.047 --> 00:14:11.947
No need to beam me up, sir.

00:14:12.049 --> 00:14:14.142
The situation is under control.

00:14:18.722 --> 00:14:20.622
Are you all right?

00:14:20.658 --> 00:14:22.649
-Yes.
-Well, what happened?

00:14:22.693 --> 00:14:24.558
Did you do anything
which might have set it off?

00:14:24.595 --> 00:14:27.723
No, but the firing program
was dynamic.

00:14:27.765 --> 00:14:29.198
The firing pro...

00:14:29.233 --> 00:14:30.700
In what way?

00:14:30.734 --> 00:14:32.201
It adjusted to my tactics.

00:14:32.236 --> 00:14:34.534
It tracked with me,
anticipating.

00:14:34.572 --> 00:14:36.836
A fixed program
could not have done that.

00:14:36.874 --> 00:14:37.966
Are you suggesting

00:14:38.075 --> 00:14:40.566
that someone was controlling
the aiming and firing sequence?

00:14:40.611 --> 00:14:42.704
That is exactly how it appeared.

00:14:42.746 --> 00:14:45.214
There was a mind
working against me.

00:14:45.249 --> 00:14:47.342
What did you do

00:14:47.384 --> 00:14:49.318
to this laser drill?

00:14:49.353 --> 00:14:53.983
A year's work... destroyed!

00:14:54.091 --> 00:14:56.184
I had no choice.

00:15:02.466 --> 00:15:05.162
We were attempting to trace
the source of the malfunction

00:15:05.202 --> 00:15:06.499
when it attacked me.

00:15:06.537 --> 00:15:08.835
How much more of this
useless fantasy

00:15:08.873 --> 00:15:10.238
do I have to listen to?

00:15:10.274 --> 00:15:11.332
None at all, Mr. Mandl.

00:15:11.375 --> 00:15:12.672
Until this is resolved

00:15:12.710 --> 00:15:14.940
I've provided temporary quarters
for you and your staff.

00:15:15.012 --> 00:15:16.604
Perhaps you'd like
to make use of them.

00:15:16.647 --> 00:15:18.945
You're overstepping
your authority, Picard.

00:15:19.049 --> 00:15:21.381
You have no right to interfere.

00:15:21.418 --> 00:15:24.478
Mr. Mandl, an attack on one
of my crew gives me the right.

00:15:24.522 --> 00:15:26.114
I have a schedule to meet.

00:15:26.157 --> 00:15:28.091
Your schedule is on hold

00:15:28.125 --> 00:15:31.686
until I have a satisfactory
explanation of this.

00:15:31.729 --> 00:15:34.357
Director Mandl...

00:15:34.398 --> 00:15:37.231
Lieutenant Yar, would you escort
the Director to his quarters?

00:15:37.268 --> 00:15:38.565
Aye, sir.

00:15:41.906 --> 00:15:43.533
Go on with your report.

00:15:43.574 --> 00:15:45.872
It would appear the
laser's drilling system

00:15:45.910 --> 00:15:47.309
was reprogrammed, sir.

00:15:47.344 --> 00:15:49.312
As soon as its memory
bank received power

00:15:49.346 --> 00:15:51.746
it turned itself on
and went after me.

00:15:51.782 --> 00:15:53.807
Fortunately, I was
able to cope with it.

00:15:53.851 --> 00:15:56.319
And not by much,
from what I saw.

00:15:56.353 --> 00:15:57.980
I believe it
was programmed

00:15:58.022 --> 00:16:00.252
to destroy any person
moving in that room, sir.

00:16:00.291 --> 00:16:02.885
Certainty or speculation?

00:16:02.927 --> 00:16:04.155
Certainty.

00:16:04.195 --> 00:16:06.663
That would have required the
talents of a master programmer.

00:16:06.697 --> 00:16:08.096
But it was done.

00:16:08.132 --> 00:16:10.293
And so,
the question becomes not who

00:16:10.334 --> 00:16:13.326
since it clearly was
one of the three terraformers

00:16:13.370 --> 00:16:15.338
the question becomes why?

00:16:15.372 --> 00:16:16.930
What are they hiding?

00:16:17.041 --> 00:16:21.239
What could be so important
that one or all of them

00:16:21.278 --> 00:16:24.805
could be desperate
enough to kill?

00:16:24.848 --> 00:16:26.611
Shall I have them
brought in?

00:16:28.219 --> 00:16:29.880
Not yet.

00:16:31.721 --> 00:16:32.949
Malencon?

00:16:32.989 --> 00:16:34.217
I couldn't save him.

00:16:34.257 --> 00:16:35.918
The injuries were too severe

00:16:35.959 --> 00:16:37.449
the damage too extensive.

00:16:37.493 --> 00:16:39.518
The entire Velara lll facility
has been powered down, Captain.

00:16:39.562 --> 00:16:41.291
We've just completed
a remote power feed

00:16:41.331 --> 00:16:43.231
to the life-support systems.

00:16:43.266 --> 00:16:44.824
Good. Data, I want you
and Geordi to return

00:16:44.867 --> 00:16:46.164
for more careful inspection.

00:16:46.202 --> 00:16:48.295
What are we to
look for, sir?

00:16:48.338 --> 00:16:49.532
Evidence of tampering

00:16:49.572 --> 00:16:50.937
negligence, sabotage,
whatever...

00:16:50.974 --> 00:16:53.306
The answer is there,
on the planet.

00:16:53.343 --> 00:16:55.470
Tasha, I want you to provide
Counselor Troi and me

00:16:55.511 --> 00:16:57.672
with complete personnel records
of our three guests.

00:16:57.714 --> 00:16:59.375
Psych profiles,
training-- everything.

00:16:59.415 --> 00:17:00.882
I'm looking for
motive, intent...

00:17:00.917 --> 00:17:02.782
the psychological capacity
to commit one murder

00:17:02.819 --> 00:17:04.150
and to attempt another.

00:17:04.187 --> 00:17:05.313
Aye, sir.

00:17:05.355 --> 00:17:07.721
It seems we are becoming
detectives, Number One.

00:17:26.409 --> 00:17:29.572
Not much left of this drill.

00:17:43.893 --> 00:17:46.555
Geordi, I need
some visual assistance.

00:17:50.667 --> 00:17:51.793
Whoa...

00:17:51.834 --> 00:17:53.495
What is it?

00:17:57.640 --> 00:17:59.665
Nothing but basic elements.

00:18:01.344 --> 00:18:02.504
Inorganic...

00:18:03.846 --> 00:18:05.313
no carbon...

00:18:05.348 --> 00:18:06.906
sandy texture...

00:18:07.016 --> 00:18:13.319
but those flashes are
almost... musical.

00:18:13.356 --> 00:18:16.723
I see color variations

00:18:16.759 --> 00:18:18.920
and... rhythms

00:18:18.961 --> 00:18:21.862
and complex harmonies.

00:18:25.702 --> 00:18:27.829
Speculation--

00:18:27.870 --> 00:18:30.168
could it be alive?

00:18:30.206 --> 00:18:33.334
How could it be alive?
It's inorganic.

00:18:33.376 --> 00:18:35.674
Whatever it is

00:18:35.712 --> 00:18:38.840
it could be what
they are covering up--

00:18:38.881 --> 00:18:43.045
and the reason
someone killed Malencon.

00:18:48.991 --> 00:18:50.515
Captain's Log, supplemental:

00:18:50.560 --> 00:18:52.494
On my order,
Data's startling discovery

00:18:52.528 --> 00:18:53.961
of a possible life-form

00:18:54.063 --> 00:18:55.963
has been beamed aboard

00:18:55.998 --> 00:18:58.432
so that its true nature
might be uncovered

00:18:58.468 --> 00:19:00.993
but unlike life on Earth
and elsewhere

00:19:01.037 --> 00:19:03.062
it appears to be
completely inorganic.

00:19:03.106 --> 00:19:04.733
A test for inorganic life.

00:19:04.774 --> 00:19:06.571
It has never
been done, Doctor.

00:19:06.609 --> 00:19:09.134
There are basic definitions
for organic life.

00:19:09.178 --> 00:19:12.011
It must have the ability
to assimilate, respirate

00:19:12.048 --> 00:19:14.846
reproduce, grow and develop,
move, secrete and excrete.

00:19:14.884 --> 00:19:16.476
Would any of those
apply here?

00:19:16.519 --> 00:19:18.180
Perhaps growth
and development.

00:19:18.221 --> 00:19:19.916
Reproduction?

00:19:20.022 --> 00:19:21.319
Yes.

00:19:21.357 --> 00:19:24.326
Those two may be basic
for any definition of life--

00:19:24.360 --> 00:19:25.827
organic or inorganic.

00:19:25.862 --> 00:19:27.830
Well, Doctor,
you're charting unknown seas.

00:19:27.864 --> 00:19:29.161
So how do we proceed?

00:19:29.198 --> 00:19:31.359
Since we're dealing with
a fundamental question

00:19:31.400 --> 00:19:33.163
Iet's use the basic
scientific method:

00:19:33.202 --> 00:19:35.170
observe, theorize and
attempt to prove it.

00:19:35.204 --> 00:19:36.671
Activate.

00:19:36.706 --> 00:19:39.675
Let's be sure of what
we're dealing with.

00:19:39.709 --> 00:19:41.677
Is the sample organic?

00:19:41.711 --> 00:19:43.178
Negative carbon.

00:19:43.212 --> 00:19:45.180
Negative known life components.

00:19:45.214 --> 00:19:46.772
Substance inorganic.

00:19:46.816 --> 00:19:47.942
Mm-hmm.

00:19:47.984 --> 00:19:49.281
Recheck analysis, please.

00:19:49.318 --> 00:19:50.683
Rechecking.

00:19:50.720 --> 00:19:52.187
Analysis verified.

00:19:52.221 --> 00:19:53.950
Not organic.

00:19:54.056 --> 00:19:57.116
Magnify to screen.

00:19:59.729 --> 00:20:02.289
Factor five.

00:20:03.299 --> 00:20:06.200
Hold surface.

00:20:06.235 --> 00:20:08.328
Factor ten.

00:20:12.275 --> 00:20:14.243
What are we looking at?

00:20:14.277 --> 00:20:17.110
It's beautiful,
whatever it is.

00:20:20.416 --> 00:20:22.407
What's that hum?

00:20:22.451 --> 00:20:26.820
It started after Dr. Crusher
ordered the scanner to magnify.

00:20:26.856 --> 00:20:29.222
Computer, demagnify.

00:20:29.258 --> 00:20:31.988
Resume normal scan.

00:20:35.231 --> 00:20:38.132
Everyone stand back.

00:20:40.169 --> 00:20:42.034
Step back again.

00:20:45.508 --> 00:20:47.999
It's us.

00:20:48.044 --> 00:20:50.512
Yes. We're causing it.

00:20:50.546 --> 00:20:52.446
Why?

00:20:52.481 --> 00:20:55.450
Unknown, but it is definitely
reacting to our presence.

00:20:55.484 --> 00:20:56.781
Perhaps it is picking up

00:20:56.819 --> 00:20:58.912
the electrical impulse
of our systems.

00:20:58.955 --> 00:21:00.923
The flashes haven't changed.

00:21:00.957 --> 00:21:03.721
Could the hum be connected
to the flashing?

00:21:03.759 --> 00:21:07.126
Computer, magnify.

00:21:07.163 --> 00:21:10.860
What is the magnification?

00:21:10.900 --> 00:21:14.392
2500 diameters.

00:21:14.437 --> 00:21:17.895
Analyze the pattern
of the flashes.

00:21:17.940 --> 00:21:21.171
Not repetitive or sequential.

00:21:21.210 --> 00:21:23.974
Pattern not recognized.

00:21:24.080 --> 00:21:27.174
What is the source
of the flashes?

00:21:27.216 --> 00:21:28.683
Unable to specify.

00:21:28.718 --> 00:21:31.687
Theoretically not possible
from this substance.

00:21:31.721 --> 00:21:33.712
Disregard incongruity

00:21:33.756 --> 00:21:37.351
and theorize as to source.

00:21:39.695 --> 00:21:42.186
Life.

00:21:54.744 --> 00:21:56.712
What do you mean, a life-form?

00:21:56.746 --> 00:21:58.714
What life-form?

00:21:58.748 --> 00:22:03.515
A Federation recon expedition
certified Velara lll lifeless.

00:22:03.552 --> 00:22:04.849
Understandable

00:22:04.887 --> 00:22:07.685
given this particular
life-form's novel nature.

00:22:07.723 --> 00:22:09.918
What is that nature?

00:22:09.959 --> 00:22:12.928
Dr. Crusher is still making
her determination.

00:22:12.962 --> 00:22:16.056
Mr. Mandl, you know
the Prime Directive.

00:22:16.098 --> 00:22:20.057
Are you saying that l
knowingly defied it?

00:22:20.102 --> 00:22:22.070
That's what I have to find out.

00:22:22.104 --> 00:22:24.072
You're a man obsessed
with what you do.

00:22:24.106 --> 00:22:26.574
Who knows what an obsessed man
will do to keep going.

00:22:26.609 --> 00:22:27.974
Kill, perhaps?

00:22:28.044 --> 00:22:31.036
I create life.

00:22:34.317 --> 00:22:36.308
I don't take it.

00:22:43.292 --> 00:22:45.760
You hit him pretty
hard, Captain.

00:22:45.795 --> 00:22:48.320
What do you think, Counselor?

00:22:48.364 --> 00:22:50.332
It was useful.

00:22:50.366 --> 00:22:52.334
I felt two levels.

00:22:52.368 --> 00:22:54.336
He did know about the life-form

00:22:54.370 --> 00:22:56.668
but the idea of murder
seemed to shock him.

00:22:56.706 --> 00:22:58.469
Whether it was the whole idea

00:22:58.507 --> 00:23:00.600
or just being accused of it,
I can't tell.

00:23:00.643 --> 00:23:02.736
What about his file,
Lieutenant Yar?

00:23:02.778 --> 00:23:05.076
Could he have accomplished
the reprogramming

00:23:05.114 --> 00:23:06.945
that Data says took place?

00:23:07.049 --> 00:23:09.313
Mandl holds advanced degrees
in computer science

00:23:09.352 --> 00:23:10.944
as well as
artificial intelligence.

00:23:11.020 --> 00:23:12.487
It's possible.

00:23:12.521 --> 00:23:14.352
What about the others,
including the victim?

00:23:14.390 --> 00:23:17.689
Well, only the victim had
the required expertise.

00:23:17.727 --> 00:23:19.354
Malencon did work
where the...

00:23:19.395 --> 00:23:21.454
whatever it is was found.

00:23:21.497 --> 00:23:23.328
Trying to suppress
that knowledge

00:23:23.366 --> 00:23:24.833
would be motive
for murder

00:23:24.867 --> 00:23:26.801
if Mandl were
obsessed enough.

00:23:26.836 --> 00:23:29.361
Terraformers are
often obsessive.

00:23:29.405 --> 00:23:32.238
It frequently goes
with the career profile.

00:23:32.274 --> 00:23:34.242
How do you read
the designer?

00:23:34.276 --> 00:23:37.245
She is possessed of highly
abstracted reality.

00:23:37.279 --> 00:23:40.339
Lovely visions,
little data.

00:23:40.383 --> 00:23:43.786
But you might do
better than l.

00:23:53.362 --> 00:23:55.455
It's not locked.

00:24:03.672 --> 00:24:05.663
Mind a visitor?

00:24:09.678 --> 00:24:11.669
Is it true?

00:24:14.183 --> 00:24:17.152
Did you really find
a life-form?

00:24:17.186 --> 00:24:21.145
Well, the debate is still
going on in some quarters

00:24:21.190 --> 00:24:24.182
but I think so, yes.

00:24:25.194 --> 00:24:27.662
What's it like?

00:24:27.696 --> 00:24:30.665
We have nothing we
can compare it with.

00:24:30.699 --> 00:24:32.667
It's microscopic.

00:24:32.701 --> 00:24:35.169
It seems
colonial, simple

00:24:35.204 --> 00:24:39.163
but it's inorganic, which is
why the recon scouts missed it.

00:24:39.208 --> 00:24:42.200
It was not your mistake.

00:24:48.150 --> 00:24:51.142
Everything I've worked
so hard for...

00:24:55.157 --> 00:24:57.648
...is falling apart.

00:25:06.168 --> 00:25:08.363
Luisa.

00:25:08.403 --> 00:25:11.372
It's very beautiful.

00:25:11.406 --> 00:25:15.308
I could arrange for you
to see it, if you like.

00:25:18.247 --> 00:25:20.238
Perhaps later.

00:25:36.031 --> 00:25:37.965
Captain, this is Dr. Crusher.

00:25:38.033 --> 00:25:40.968
I think you better come
to the medical lab.

00:25:47.009 --> 00:25:48.374
What is it?

00:25:48.410 --> 00:25:49.604
Geordi observed movement.

00:25:49.645 --> 00:25:50.873
Not movement, exactly

00:25:50.913 --> 00:25:52.608
but a definite shift
in the energy pattern.

00:25:52.648 --> 00:25:54.343
Without external
influence.

00:25:54.383 --> 00:25:55.372
The hum is gone, too.

00:25:55.417 --> 00:25:56.384
Why?

00:25:56.418 --> 00:25:59.216
Unknown, sir. Perhaps
it is scanning us.

00:25:59.254 --> 00:26:00.221
Scanning us?

00:26:00.255 --> 00:26:02.416
Why? What would it
hope to learn?

00:26:02.457 --> 00:26:04.652
Unknown at this
time, sir.

00:26:04.693 --> 00:26:06.354
It's changing.

00:26:08.163 --> 00:26:10.131
I don't see anything.

00:26:10.165 --> 00:26:13.498
The infrared range
is increasing.

00:26:13.535 --> 00:26:17.130
Warning. Input overload.

00:26:17.172 --> 00:26:18.639
The hum is back.

00:26:18.674 --> 00:26:20.642
It is projecting
an energy field.

00:26:20.676 --> 00:26:23.236
And it's
intensifying.

00:26:26.348 --> 00:26:30.182
Magnification deactivated.

00:26:40.462 --> 00:26:42.760
Two of them?

00:26:44.232 --> 00:26:48.692
Only life can replicate
itself, Doctor.

00:26:48.737 --> 00:26:53.470
Inorganic or not,
it is alive.

00:26:59.081 --> 00:27:03.950
Activate quarantine field.

00:27:06.455 --> 00:27:10.118
Quarantine field, full.

00:27:10.158 --> 00:27:12.991
Full shield backup.

00:27:15.130 --> 00:27:17.189
Evacuating lab.

00:27:17.232 --> 00:27:20.201
Translation request being
patched.

00:27:20.235 --> 00:27:21.827
Translation? From whom?

00:27:25.607 --> 00:27:27.097
Evacuate.

00:27:30.379 --> 00:27:32.847
What's wrong with the
translator circuit?

00:27:32.881 --> 00:27:35.850
Bridge, this is the Captain.

00:27:35.884 --> 00:27:38.944
Request emergency power to
initiate lab quarantine seal.

00:27:39.054 --> 00:27:40.453
Do it, Mr. Worf.

00:27:40.489 --> 00:27:41.786
Aye, sir.

00:27:41.823 --> 00:27:43.484
What's the nature
of the problem, Captain?

00:27:43.525 --> 00:27:44.651
We've lost visual.

00:27:44.693 --> 00:27:47.662
We have confirmed
that Data's discovery is life

00:27:47.696 --> 00:27:52.360
but more than that...
it is intelligent life.

00:27:52.401 --> 00:27:56.667
How do you know, sir?

00:28:01.143 --> 00:28:04.135
It's trying
to communicate with us.

00:28:08.783 --> 00:28:10.751
Captain's Log, supplemental:

00:28:10.785 --> 00:28:13.253
The inorganic life-form
from Velara lll

00:28:13.288 --> 00:28:15.916
has apparently taken over
our medical lab.

00:28:15.990 --> 00:28:17.116
It generates enough energy

00:28:17.158 --> 00:28:19.023
to interfere with the
surrounding systems.

00:28:19.060 --> 00:28:20.925
Mr. La Forge,
can we see into the lab yet?

00:28:20.962 --> 00:28:22.554
Negative, Captain.
Reducing the backup

00:28:22.597 --> 00:28:24.064
to the quarantine seal
might help.

00:28:24.098 --> 00:28:25.224
Doctor?

00:28:25.266 --> 00:28:26.233
I wouldn't.

00:28:26.267 --> 00:28:27.393
Continue quarantine.

00:28:27.435 --> 00:28:28.925
Aye, sir.

00:28:28.970 --> 00:28:31.404
Director Mandl and the others
in the observation lounge

00:28:31.439 --> 00:28:32.599
as you requested.

00:28:32.640 --> 00:28:33.937
Counselor,
I shall need you.

00:28:33.975 --> 00:28:35.408
You have the Bridge,
Number One.

00:28:39.447 --> 00:28:41.677
Director Mandl,
I put it to you again.

00:28:41.716 --> 00:28:44.116
What do you know
about these life-forms?

00:28:44.152 --> 00:28:45.619
Not a thing.

00:28:45.653 --> 00:28:46.984
Enough.

00:28:49.490 --> 00:28:50.957
Sit down, Lieutenant.

00:28:50.992 --> 00:28:53.085
You are deliberately evasive
and it must stop.

00:28:53.127 --> 00:28:54.617
You have kept information
from me

00:28:54.662 --> 00:28:56.459
since our first communication.

00:28:56.497 --> 00:28:59.295
An alien life-form
has taken possession

00:28:59.334 --> 00:29:00.961
of my medical lab.

00:29:03.004 --> 00:29:05.905
You knew of its existence.

00:29:05.974 --> 00:29:07.441
Yes.

00:29:07.475 --> 00:29:08.533
Is this true?

00:29:08.576 --> 00:29:11.875
You knew there was
life on Velara lll?

00:29:11.913 --> 00:29:15.508
I knew that there were
random energy patterns.

00:29:15.550 --> 00:29:18.246
Yes, I knew that,
but not life.

00:29:18.286 --> 00:29:21.619
Not by any definition
that I've ever heard.

00:29:21.656 --> 00:29:24.648
But you tried to keep
that knowledge from us.

00:29:24.692 --> 00:29:28.253
No, they are meaningless
silicon crystals

00:29:28.296 --> 00:29:30.457
which rebroadcast sunlight.

00:29:30.498 --> 00:29:32.989
It is a life-form
and it has intelligence.

00:29:35.970 --> 00:29:37.870
Why do you say that?

00:29:37.905 --> 00:29:40.203
It's trying to communicate
with us.

00:29:40.241 --> 00:29:42.539
Communicate with you?

00:29:42.577 --> 00:29:45.341
When did you first become aware
of them?

00:29:47.115 --> 00:29:49.948
Tell them about the pattern
in the sand.

00:29:50.051 --> 00:29:52.781
Oh, yes, do tell us.

00:29:55.123 --> 00:29:56.954
When we first arrived

00:29:56.991 --> 00:29:59.824
we noticed that
in certain areas

00:29:59.861 --> 00:30:02.523
the sand had
a sparkling effect

00:30:02.563 --> 00:30:06.329
Iike sunlight bouncing off
new-fallen snow.

00:30:06.367 --> 00:30:08.301
What did you think it was?

00:30:08.336 --> 00:30:11.772
Honestly, we did not
give it any thought.

00:30:11.806 --> 00:30:14.775
Picard, I must point out again

00:30:14.809 --> 00:30:19.269
that we were assured--
not once, but many times--

00:30:19.313 --> 00:30:23.773
by the best scientific minds
in the Federation

00:30:23.818 --> 00:30:27.481
that this planet has no life--
no life!

00:30:27.522 --> 00:30:29.581
And we were not looking

00:30:29.624 --> 00:30:31.990
and therefore we did not see.

00:30:32.093 --> 00:30:34.527
All right,
at first you dismissed it

00:30:34.562 --> 00:30:36.826
but then,
you began to understand

00:30:36.864 --> 00:30:38.491
there was something

00:30:38.533 --> 00:30:40.524
that was different
about them.

00:30:40.568 --> 00:30:42.502
You can't know that.

00:30:42.537 --> 00:30:46.268
Your apprehension suggested it
when we first arrived.

00:30:46.307 --> 00:30:48.400
Tell me about these patterns.

00:30:48.443 --> 00:30:51.742
At first we thought
it was just natural phenomenon

00:30:51.779 --> 00:30:53.303
unique to Velara lll.

00:30:53.347 --> 00:30:54.507
Refraction

00:30:54.549 --> 00:30:58.610
in a thin atmosphere
is interesting

00:30:58.653 --> 00:31:00.018
but certainly not life.

00:31:00.121 --> 00:31:01.748
Why was I never
told about this?

00:31:01.789 --> 00:31:04.553
Because it's not
particularly important.

00:31:04.592 --> 00:31:05.616
As the building

00:31:05.660 --> 00:31:08.493
of the terraforming
station went forward

00:31:08.529 --> 00:31:11.054
the patterns in the sand
ceased being random.

00:31:11.099 --> 00:31:13.329
They became very specific.

00:31:13.367 --> 00:31:17.167
Geometric shapes suddenly
appearing, disappearing

00:31:17.205 --> 00:31:18.797
uh, changing location

00:31:18.840 --> 00:31:19.966
changing size.

00:31:20.074 --> 00:31:21.564
Did you ever feel

00:31:21.609 --> 00:31:26.205
that these patterns
were attempting to communicate?

00:31:28.883 --> 00:31:31.078
No, never.

00:31:32.487 --> 00:31:33.977
Bensen?

00:31:34.021 --> 00:31:35.488
I don't know.

00:31:35.523 --> 00:31:38.981
At the time,
I didn't think so

00:31:39.026 --> 00:31:43.656
but now after hearing
what you just said...

00:31:43.698 --> 00:31:45.165
now... I don't know.

00:31:45.199 --> 00:31:48.498
Captain, we've regained
magnification on the life-form.

00:31:48.536 --> 00:31:49.798
It's divided again.

00:31:49.837 --> 00:31:51.998
Patch visual
to observation lounge.

00:31:58.312 --> 00:32:03.249
There was no indication
of any of this on Velara lll.

00:32:03.284 --> 00:32:04.808
Absolutely none.

00:32:08.156 --> 00:32:10.954
I cannot understand
the patterns.

00:32:11.058 --> 00:32:12.184
Neither can l.

00:32:12.226 --> 00:32:14.854
Please show me
spectral analysis--

00:32:14.896 --> 00:32:16.363
magnification 12k.

00:32:16.397 --> 00:32:17.762
Silicon, germanium.

00:32:17.798 --> 00:32:19.425
Transistor material.

00:32:19.467 --> 00:32:20.764
Gallium arsenide.

00:32:20.801 --> 00:32:22.769
Emits light when charged.

00:32:22.803 --> 00:32:24.862
Cadmium selenide, sulfide.

00:32:24.906 --> 00:32:26.703
Emits charge when lit.

00:32:26.741 --> 00:32:28.868
Water, impurities,
sodium salts.

00:32:28.910 --> 00:32:30.241
Conductor.

00:32:31.479 --> 00:32:33.106
But is it alive?

00:32:33.147 --> 00:32:35.172
Probability positive.

00:32:35.216 --> 00:32:37.275
I wasn't
asking you.

00:32:37.318 --> 00:32:39.445
Engineering to Bridge.

00:32:39.487 --> 00:32:41.421
This is Commander Riker,
go ahead.

00:32:41.455 --> 00:32:44.822
The backup on the lab seal
is fluctuating, sir.

00:32:44.859 --> 00:32:47.350
I think you should
come down here.

00:32:47.395 --> 00:32:49.192
On my way.

00:32:50.064 --> 00:32:52.089
Data, you've got the Bridge.

00:32:52.133 --> 00:32:53.725
Inform the Captain.

00:32:59.507 --> 00:33:00.769
Status, Ensign.

00:33:00.808 --> 00:33:03.368
The quarantine seal
is getting weaker, sir.

00:33:03.411 --> 00:33:05.777
Every time I try
to redirect backup

00:33:05.813 --> 00:33:07.405
it goes somewhere else.

00:33:07.448 --> 00:33:08.472
I think I've...

00:33:08.516 --> 00:33:11.383
No, it's locked three
people in a turbolift

00:33:11.419 --> 00:33:12.443
and two more

00:33:12.486 --> 00:33:14.249
in the programmers'
rest room.

00:33:14.288 --> 00:33:16.552
If that reading is right,
there is no seal.

00:33:16.591 --> 00:33:17.956
Give me lab
interior image.

00:33:18.025 --> 00:33:19.014
Yes, sir.

00:33:22.396 --> 00:33:24.990
Magnify.

00:33:26.033 --> 00:33:29.730
Picard, this is Riker.

00:33:29.770 --> 00:33:32.432
We see it, too,
Number One.

00:33:38.512 --> 00:33:40.377
Get that seal back up!

00:33:40.414 --> 00:33:41.676
Sir, no matter what I do

00:33:41.716 --> 00:33:43.547
the energy goes
somewhere else.

00:33:43.584 --> 00:33:45.984
What if it hits
the Sick Bay or Nursery?

00:33:46.053 --> 00:33:47.884
Hold off.
Impossible, Captain.

00:33:47.922 --> 00:33:50.789
We haven't got the power.

00:33:50.825 --> 00:33:52.725
Captain's Log, supplemental:

00:33:52.760 --> 00:33:56.594
The life-form, which has
significantly increased in size

00:33:56.631 --> 00:34:00.362
is again attempting
to communicate with us.

00:34:00.401 --> 00:34:03.837
The universal translator
is coming on-line, sir.

00:34:03.871 --> 00:34:05.304
Ugly...

00:34:05.339 --> 00:34:10.072
ugly... giant... bags
of mostly water...

00:34:10.111 --> 00:34:12.079
Bags of mostly water?

00:34:12.113 --> 00:34:14.240
An accurate description
of humans, sir.

00:34:14.282 --> 00:34:15.715
You are over 90% water

00:34:15.750 --> 00:34:17.843
surrounded by
a flexible container.

00:34:20.021 --> 00:34:25.049
Life force,
do you understand us?

00:34:27.228 --> 00:34:29.287
We understand.

00:34:29.330 --> 00:34:32.094
We ask that you be gone.

00:34:32.133 --> 00:34:35.694
We call, we talk,
you do not listen.

00:34:35.736 --> 00:34:37.761
We didn't hear you.

00:34:37.805 --> 00:34:39.636
We come in peace.

00:34:39.674 --> 00:34:42.370
Ugly bag of mostly water

00:34:42.410 --> 00:34:44.571
we try at peace.

00:34:44.612 --> 00:34:47.513
You still do not listen.

00:34:47.548 --> 00:34:52.986
Bag who drilled in sand of home
had to die.

00:34:53.020 --> 00:34:54.715
It killed Malencon.

00:34:56.624 --> 00:34:59.718
We see and hear you now.

00:34:59.760 --> 00:35:03.628
We didn't know you were there.

00:35:03.664 --> 00:35:06.758
You are beautiful to us.

00:35:06.801 --> 00:35:09.634
All life is beautiful.

00:35:09.670 --> 00:35:12.230
Bags in dome did know.

00:35:12.273 --> 00:35:16.073
Caused much death.

00:35:16.110 --> 00:35:18.704
Make us kill.

00:35:18.746 --> 00:35:22.876
War is now with you.

00:35:22.917 --> 00:35:26.717
The translator
is off-line, sir.

00:35:26.754 --> 00:35:28.654
Can you hear us now?

00:35:31.158 --> 00:35:32.648
Mr. La Forge?

00:35:32.693 --> 00:35:35.321
Restabilizing, Captain.

00:35:35.363 --> 00:35:38.696
Sir, that chaos when we were
studying it in the lab

00:35:38.733 --> 00:35:42.430
must have been the energy surge
of a reproductive cycle.

00:35:42.470 --> 00:35:44.768
It is now a colony
of single cells

00:35:44.805 --> 00:35:47.968
which organize as a computer
and like any computer...

00:35:48.042 --> 00:35:51.603
More is stronger.

00:36:02.087 --> 00:36:03.918
Captain's Log, supplemental:

00:36:03.956 --> 00:36:06.186
We have regained visual contact
with the lab

00:36:06.225 --> 00:36:08.352
but our attempts
to restore communication

00:36:08.394 --> 00:36:10.862
with this microbrain,
as we have come to call it

00:36:10.896 --> 00:36:12.420
have been unsuccessful.

00:36:12.464 --> 00:36:14.489
One thing that is certain,
however

00:36:14.533 --> 00:36:16.797
this life-form
has declared war on us.

00:36:16.835 --> 00:36:18.132
The range of influence

00:36:18.170 --> 00:36:20.229
appears to be concentrated
in the medical lab, Captain.

00:36:20.272 --> 00:36:21.762
All nonessential personnel

00:36:21.807 --> 00:36:24.332
have been moved to the most
distant areas of the ship, sir.

00:36:24.376 --> 00:36:26.640
Data, any analysis on those
bolts of light it emits?

00:36:26.678 --> 00:36:29.044
That seems to be its method
of reprogramming, Captain.

00:36:29.081 --> 00:36:30.514
Each bolt of light consists

00:36:30.549 --> 00:36:32.540
of negatively
and positively charged ions--

00:36:32.584 --> 00:36:34.745
a series of program
instructions, as it were.

00:36:34.787 --> 00:36:36.220
It seems to have

00:36:36.255 --> 00:36:38.689
a quicker rapport
with our computers than we have.

00:36:38.724 --> 00:36:40.214
What do you expect?

00:36:40.259 --> 00:36:41.624
It is a computer.

00:36:41.660 --> 00:36:43.958
Have we disabled the medical lab
computer console?

00:36:44.063 --> 00:36:45.724
Aye, sir. As soon
as Data determined

00:36:45.764 --> 00:36:47.527
the microbrain's method
of operation.

00:36:47.566 --> 00:36:50.967
Captain, picking up a decrease
in infrared intensity.

00:36:51.070 --> 00:36:53.971
Maybe the life-form
has reached its energy level.

00:36:54.039 --> 00:36:56.098
Or maybe that's not
the end of it.

00:36:56.141 --> 00:36:58.666
With single-celled
life-forms

00:36:58.710 --> 00:37:00.405
at least organic ones

00:37:00.446 --> 00:37:04.041
cell division is preceded
by a resting state.

00:37:04.083 --> 00:37:06.608
The calm before the storm.

00:37:06.652 --> 00:37:09.280
Medical lab on main viewer.

00:37:09.321 --> 00:37:11.312
Let's use this calm.

00:37:14.893 --> 00:37:17.691
It does seem dormant, Captain.

00:37:19.965 --> 00:37:23.560
Tasha...

00:37:23.602 --> 00:37:28.699
set coordinates to beam it back
where it came from.

00:37:28.740 --> 00:37:30.537
Coordinates set, sir.

00:37:30.576 --> 00:37:32.407
Energize.

00:37:41.453 --> 00:37:44.183
Transporter power beam
redirected, sir.

00:37:44.223 --> 00:37:47.784
We are unable
to affect it.

00:37:54.032 --> 00:37:56.796
Life-form or not,
intelligent or not

00:37:56.835 --> 00:38:00.601
the safety of this ship
and everyone aboard her

00:38:00.639 --> 00:38:03.005
is my primary responsibility.

00:38:03.041 --> 00:38:06.909
Data, evacuate all the air
from the medical lab.

00:38:06.945 --> 00:38:08.776
I want a vacuum there.

00:38:11.416 --> 00:38:14.681
Environmental systems fail
to respond to command, Captain.

00:38:14.720 --> 00:38:17.712
It appears the microbrain
has successfully interfaced

00:38:17.756 --> 00:38:19.519
with our computers.

00:38:25.030 --> 00:38:27.362
Picard, if it did try
to communicate with us

00:38:27.399 --> 00:38:28.764
we didn't understand that!

00:38:28.800 --> 00:38:31.826
It has declared a state of war
and we are on the defensive.

00:38:31.870 --> 00:38:34.805
We have no control over our
medical lab, nor our computer.

00:38:34.840 --> 00:38:37.502
At this moment, it has the power
to destroy this ship

00:38:37.543 --> 00:38:38.840
and everybody on it!

00:38:38.877 --> 00:38:39.935
I need your help.

00:38:40.045 --> 00:38:41.672
Unbelievable.

00:38:41.713 --> 00:38:43.408
It said you were trying
to kill some of them.

00:38:43.448 --> 00:38:44.415
I need to know how.

00:38:44.449 --> 00:38:46.246
I don't know.

00:38:46.285 --> 00:38:49.686
What was Malencon doing
when he was killed?

00:38:49.721 --> 00:38:51.245
There is a
very thin layer

00:38:51.290 --> 00:38:54.157
of highly saline water
under the sandy topsoil.

00:38:54.193 --> 00:38:55.751
He was siphoning
that off.

00:38:55.794 --> 00:38:59.560
Perhaps somehow that saline
water sustained them.

00:38:59.598 --> 00:39:01.156
It connected them.

00:39:01.200 --> 00:39:02.326
I don't understand.

00:39:02.367 --> 00:39:03.698
The microbrains may be

00:39:03.735 --> 00:39:05.134
Iike our own brain cells.

00:39:05.170 --> 00:39:08.003
Individually, a cell
has life but not intelligence.

00:39:08.040 --> 00:39:09.837
Yet when
interconnected

00:39:09.875 --> 00:39:12.435
their combined
intelligence is formidable.

00:39:12.477 --> 00:39:15.139
The saline fluid
is their circuitry.

00:39:15.180 --> 00:39:18.547
And to prevent its loss,
they killed Malencon.

00:39:20.986 --> 00:39:25.582
If we had continued
to remove that water

00:39:25.624 --> 00:39:29.424
we would have
destroyed them all.

00:39:29.461 --> 00:39:32.794
A reason enough for anyone
to go to war.

00:39:34.900 --> 00:39:37.494
Captain, it's happening again.

00:39:37.536 --> 00:39:39.766
I think
you'd better get in here.

00:39:49.314 --> 00:39:51.509
If this keeps up

00:39:51.550 --> 00:39:52.778
it will tear up
the Enterprise.

00:39:52.818 --> 00:39:55.116
What can you determine,
Mr. La Forge?

00:39:55.153 --> 00:39:57.348
Captain, our sensors indicate
that the microbrain

00:39:57.389 --> 00:39:59.118
expends a tremendous
amount of energy

00:39:59.157 --> 00:40:00.454
during its
reproductive cycle

00:40:00.492 --> 00:40:02.255
yet there is
no discernible power drain

00:40:02.294 --> 00:40:03.261
on our own systems.

00:40:03.295 --> 00:40:04.956
Then what is feeding
the damn thing?

00:40:04.997 --> 00:40:06.965
We found traces
of cadmium salts.

00:40:06.999 --> 00:40:09.365
Now, cadmium is a conduit
for converting infrared

00:40:09.401 --> 00:40:10.425
into electricity.

00:40:10.469 --> 00:40:11.527
Meaning?

00:40:11.570 --> 00:40:14.437
The microbrain might
be photoelectric.

00:40:14.473 --> 00:40:17.670
Kill the lights
in the medical lab, La Forge.

00:40:17.709 --> 00:40:20.974
Let's see if darkness
will neutralize it.

00:40:21.013 --> 00:40:23.208
Sorry, sir. It still
has control of the computer.

00:40:23.248 --> 00:40:24.579
We can't do it
by remote.

00:40:24.616 --> 00:40:25.583
Number One.

00:40:25.617 --> 00:40:26.914
Aye, sir.

00:40:26.952 --> 00:40:31.616
The life-form must have evolved
at that narrow layer

00:40:31.657 --> 00:40:36.151
where the light got through
the sand to the water.

00:40:36.194 --> 00:40:41.325
Drop the water a centimeter
below light penetration level

00:40:41.366 --> 00:40:42.856
and they starve.

00:40:50.642 --> 00:40:53.941
Killing the lab lights...

00:40:53.979 --> 00:40:55.344
now.

00:40:58.850 --> 00:41:02.308
It's slowing down.

00:41:02.354 --> 00:41:06.256
It's getting dimmer, too.

00:41:06.291 --> 00:41:09.124
More light, please.

00:41:09.161 --> 00:41:11.629
Only if you will talk to us.

00:41:11.663 --> 00:41:12.823
We die.

00:41:12.864 --> 00:41:17.460
Bags of water kill us.

00:41:17.502 --> 00:41:21.632
You are like others.

00:41:21.673 --> 00:41:23.903
We have no wish to kill you.

00:41:23.942 --> 00:41:25.068
We never have.

00:41:25.110 --> 00:41:27.578
You do not say truth.

00:41:27.612 --> 00:41:29.842
We will end this war

00:41:29.881 --> 00:41:32.611
if you will end the war.

00:41:32.651 --> 00:41:36.883
Darkness... death... terrible.

00:41:36.922 --> 00:41:42.087
Must go home to wet sand.

00:41:42.127 --> 00:41:45.688
War over.

00:41:45.731 --> 00:41:46.925
Agreed.

00:41:46.965 --> 00:41:50.401
We will send you home
to your wet sand.

00:41:50.435 --> 00:41:51.993
Picard to Riker.

00:41:52.104 --> 00:41:55.437
Bring up the lights
in the lab...

00:41:55.474 --> 00:41:56.634
just a bit.

00:42:02.514 --> 00:42:05.347
Are you better?

00:42:05.384 --> 00:42:06.612
Better.

00:42:06.651 --> 00:42:09.677
We mean you no harm.

00:42:09.721 --> 00:42:11.780
Do you believe me?

00:42:11.823 --> 00:42:12.949
Yes.

00:42:12.991 --> 00:42:14.117
Good.

00:42:14.159 --> 00:42:17.458
It is important
that you trust us.

00:42:17.496 --> 00:42:20.761
Not yet.

00:42:20.799 --> 00:42:24.200
You are still too arrogant

00:42:24.236 --> 00:42:26.830
too primitive.

00:42:26.872 --> 00:42:31.775
Come back three centuries.

00:42:31.810 --> 00:42:38.739
Perhaps then we trust.

00:42:38.784 --> 00:42:44.086
We understand
what you are saying.

00:42:44.122 --> 00:42:46.989
We will leave you

00:42:47.058 --> 00:42:50.653
and we will send you home.

00:43:09.648 --> 00:43:12.481
Riker to Transporter Chief.

00:43:12.517 --> 00:43:16.510
Pick up the coordinates
of the bell jar

00:43:16.555 --> 00:43:21.117
in the medical lab
for return to Velara lll.

00:43:21.159 --> 00:43:23.593
Coordinates entered, sir.

00:43:28.600 --> 00:43:31.068
Riker to Bridge.

00:43:31.102 --> 00:43:38.975
Captain, we're ready to beam it
back to the planet.

00:43:39.010 --> 00:43:41.774
I wish we were able
to learn more about them, sir.

00:43:41.813 --> 00:43:46.614
In time, Mr. Data,
when we are better prepared.

00:43:48.620 --> 00:43:52.989
I wanted to create a place where
living things could thrive

00:43:53.024 --> 00:43:54.992
and all the while

00:43:55.093 --> 00:43:59.427
I was about to destroy the life
that is there.

00:43:59.464 --> 00:44:01.091
Our apologies.

00:44:01.132 --> 00:44:02.690
And respects.

00:44:02.734 --> 00:44:04.599
Lieutenant Yar?

00:44:04.636 --> 00:44:08.595
Coordinates set, sir.

00:44:08.640 --> 00:44:10.574
Energize.

00:44:20.517 --> 00:44:23.953
Captain's Log,
Stardate 41464.8:

00:44:23.987 --> 00:44:26.455
I have declared an indefinite
quarantine for Velara lll

00:44:26.490 --> 00:44:28.515
and we are now returning
to Starbase

00:44:28.558 --> 00:44:30.958
with the three surviving
terraformers.

00:44:31.061 --> 00:44:34.792
Perhaps the lesson we have
learned from this near tragedy

00:44:34.831 --> 00:44:37.561
will prevent it
from happening elsewhere.
